                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2ee8bc8e-bab1-39ba-a1b5-e48c3595216d",
                        "entry_id": "6af5bef0-b791-38ee-b8e7-8f31db15feef",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An article of clothing worn as underpants by women."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "in-compounds",
                            "plural-normally"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b0dbdd72-fdd5-4883-bf3d-8e5dc1db5863",
                                "sense_id": "2ee8bc8e-bab1-39ba-a1b5-e48c3595216d",
                                "text": "1952 October 13, Advertisement, Life, page 13,\nFor, unlike old-fashioned diapers, PLAYTEX Dryper confines all wetness to the panty area; brings your baby a whole new world of comfort plus cleaner, finer protection."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7f757528-d2cd-4c3d-b675-f6b162b3f6c9",
                                "sense_id": "2ee8bc8e-bab1-39ba-a1b5-e48c3595216d",
                                "text": "2003, Glamour, Volume 101, Issues 4-6, page number unknown,\n“One time I was going to run and change before a concert because I realized I had panty lines showing,” says Britta Phillips, […] ."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0313a58a-6581-4a77-bddc-0e94c069dc6a",
                                "sense_id": "2ee8bc8e-bab1-39ba-a1b5-e48c3595216d",
                                "text": "That puts their panty well over 1000% higher priced than the Hanes panty and roughly 300% higher priced than the Victoria′s Secret panty. All three are cotton bikini panties. Not much difference in the actual panty but a huge discrepancy in prices."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "fa39b38c-26b2-35ae-b46d-e88fb1070f8d",
                        "entry_id": "6af5bef0-b791-38ee-b8e7-8f31db15feef",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A helmet cover."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "informal"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ce71747f-e7e5-4f7b-88f7-5e283d390dea",
                                "sense_id": "fa39b38c-26b2-35ae-b46d-e88fb1070f8d",
                                "text": "There is a special play called “Passing the Star” that allows the jammer to remove her helmet panty and hand it over to the pivot."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2fd8d58e-97f0-43c0-aac3-1dc1d50b3762",
                                "sense_id": "fa39b38c-26b2-35ae-b46d-e88fb1070f8d",
                                "text": "We′re practicing this strategy right now. Francesca is the Jammer, and she′s supposed to pass me the helmet panty. Bruisey-Q is assisting her, helping her get through the pack by knocking the formidable ass of ThunderSmack out of the way."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b774fcfd-93a5-4787-9dfe-cacb7fb01dfb",
                                "sense_id": "fa39b38c-26b2-35ae-b46d-e88fb1070f8d",
                                "text": "\"If you get jammed in, hand me the panty. You can't throw it at me.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            }
        ],
